am\n\n# Go into the client directory and run the tests.\ncd clients/js\npnpm install\npnpm build\npnpm test\n```\n\nYou may also use the following scripts to lint and/or format your JavaScript client.\n\n```sh\npnpm lint\npnpm lint:fix\npnpm format\npnpm format:fix\n```\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}